("api/drag-tree-item" :names ("drag-tree-item") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Run a bounded native move drag with a temporary same-tree drop target. Copied private per-drag identity prevents foreign, stale and cross-tree drops. This returns a target only; it does not mutate items or touch files. Starts synchronously while the original mouse event is live, required by Cocoa." :position 131648)
