("api/end-modal" :names ("end-modal") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Call raw native EndModal with the selected result. This is not an OK-button click: it does not invoke button validation or native data transfer. Native IsModal can become false before SHOW-MODAL returns; the active modal lifetime guard remains until that call unwinds. Generic internal prompt cancellation unwinds internal-to-outer sequentially. Raw :OK does not enforce file must-exist/overwrite checks; actual native OK-button behavior handles configured validation. While an internal prompt is active, successful completion of the public outer dialog (:OK/:YES/:NO) rejects; only :CANCEL requests sequential unwind of the entire workflow." :position 141024)
