("api/event-id" :names ("event-id" "(setf event-id)") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Read a saved pre-callback ID or current native GetId. Context SETF changes event metadata and later native ID matching, not the source window ID or binding filters. Earlier snapshots stay unchanged. No dispatch restart or callback-order guarantee." :position 190454)
