("api/notebook-tab-colours" :names ("notebook-tab-colours" "(setf notebook-tab-colours)") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Install owned flat wxAuiGenericTabArt subclass with copied colors; NIL restores default art. Solid rectangular surfaces and contrast-aware text/close glyphs replace gradients/bevels. A thin selected edge marks the active tab. Scroll/list glyphs and other native chrome follow system appearance. Preserves pages and selection. Replacement art receives current sizing in every private tab group without requiring a resize, keeping captions visible." :position 458671)
