("api/single-choice-dialog" :names ("single-choice-dialog") :kind :class :kind-name "Class" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Construct a modal-only native single-choice dialog. Selection is always an in-range nonnegative index; NIL is not a choice. Strings are Unicode without NUL; empty strings are accepted. Defaults/subclass slot initargs and AFTER hooks use the native-backed CLOS protocol. Failed managed initialization destroys newly created resources; it does not reverse arbitrary external mutations." :position 575105)
