("api/text-entry-dialog" :names ("text-entry-dialog") :kind :class :kind-name "Class" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Construct a modal-only native text-entry dialog. Dialog value is native stored value, not a promise of live edit-buffer contents. Strings are Unicode without NUL; empty strings are accepted. Defaults/subclass slot initargs and AFTER hooks use the native-backed CLOS protocol. Failed managed initialization destroys newly created resources; it does not reverse arbitrary external mutations." :position 683154)
