("example/examples/document-form.lisp" :names ("examples/document-form.lisp" "document-form") :kind :example :kind-name "Example" :summary "Persistent UTF-8 form with deferred shared Open/Save/Save As/Copy/Paste/close actions via menus, toolbar and portable keyboard IDs; status feedback, first-request coalescing, delivery-time state, save/discard/cancel and scoped close replay. EXERCISE uses a canceled scripted toolbar Save. Clipboard tests isolate system content; native OS panels, physical shortcuts and multiline editing remain outside this example." :position 1758500)
("example/examples/drawing-monitor.lisp" :names ("examples/drawing-monitor.lisp" "drawing-monitor") :kind :example :kind-name "Example" :summary "Retained native canvas with bounded geometry, Unicode text/font/RGB/bitmap adapters, activity animation and owner-bound periodic UI updates. EXERCISE self-stops after three real timer ticks, exports PNG and resumes; data is simulated, not background work." :position 1776259)
